<title>UK: EU cuts wheat import duties.</title>
<headline>EU cuts wheat import duties.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Wednesday it was cutting its import duty on distant high and medium quality wheat to 13.83 Ecus per tonne and 37.63 Ecus, respectively, effective July 31.  </p>
<p>EFFECTIVE FROM JULY 31 ECUS PER TONNE</p>
